  m_text: "Music Credits:\r\nOpenGameArt.org, Marcus Rasseli, The Battle (https://opengameart.org/content/the-battle)
    \u2013 Lobby Music\r\nOpenGameArt.org, Cynicmusic, Battle Theme A, (https://opengameart.org/content/battle-theme-a)
    \u2013 Nyxfall Expanse Battle Music\r\nOpenGameArt.org, Matthew Pablo, Dark Descent
    \u2013 Extended Cut (https://opengameart.org/content/dark-descent-extended-cut)
    \u2013 Scorchveil Reach Battle Music\r\nOpenGameArt.org, Juhani Junkala, Epic
    Boss Battle (https://opengameart.org/content/boss-battle-music) \u2013 ThornBloom
    Hollow Battle Music\r\nOpenGameArt.org, cynicmusic, Victory Fanfare Short (https://opengameart.org/content/victory-fanfare-short)
    \u2013 Victory Music\r\nOpenGameArt.org, RandomMind, Medieval: Defeat Theme (https://opengameart.org/content/medieval-defeat-theme) 
    - Defeat Music\n\r\nArt Credits:\r\nCharacter, Card, Main Menu Selection Screen
    Art : Caitlin Delport\r\nBattlefield Background Art: Gemini, gemini.google.com
    \n\r\nBackstory & Storyline Credits:\r\nDiyal Kara\n\r\nDevelopment Credits:\r\nAmeen
    Dawood\r\nDiyal Kara\r\nCaitlin Delport"
